{{ ui.pricelist([services | service("Korean Lash Lift"), services | service("Brow Lamination"), services | service("Eyebrow Wax & Tint"), services | service("Eyelash Tint"), services | service("LVL & Brow Lamination Package")]) }}
</div>
<figure data-reveal><div class="frame">{{ ui.picture("lash-print", sizes="(min-width: 64em) 30vw, 100vw", ratio="45") }}</div><figcaption>Small tracked-caps caption</figcaption></figure>
</div>
</div>
</section>

{#- ===== Reviews ===== -#}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="reviews">
<div class="wrap">
{{ ui.sectionHead("Reviews", eyebrow="Components · 11", id="reviews") }}
{{ ui.stat(site.reviews.count, "Five-star reviews on " + site.reviews.source + " since " + site.reviews.since.slice(0, 4)) }}
<div class="grid grid--3" style="margin-top:var(--s-6)" data-stagger="110">
{{ ui.review("[[TODO: full review text from Phorest]]", "[[TODO: first name and surname initial]]", "[[TODO: month and year]]") }}
{{ ui.review("[[TODO: full review text from Phorest]]", "[[TODO: first name and surname initial]]", "[[TODO: month and year]]") }}
{{ ui.review("[[TODO: full review text from Phorest]]", "[[TODO: first name and surname initial]]", "[[TODO: month and year]]") }}
</div>
</div>
</section>

{#- ===== Visit ===== -#}
<section class="section section--deep" aria-labelledby="visit" style="--bg:var(--c-ivory-deep)">
<div class="wrap">
{{ ui.sectionHead("Visit and contact", eyebrow="Components · 12", id="visit", lead="Live opening status, today’s hours highlighted, tap to call, tap the address to copy it, and a map that opens Google Maps.") }}
<div class="sg-visit">
<div class="stack">
<h3 class="h4">Opening hours</h3>
<p>{{ ui.openStatus() }}</p>
{{ ui.hours() }}
</div>
<div class="stack">
<h3 class="h4">Find us</h3>
{{ ui.address() }}
<p><a class="link tnum" href="tel:{{ site.phone.tel }}">{{ site.phone.display }}</a></p>
<p class="soft small">{{ site.parking }}</p>
</div>
<div class="stack">
{{ ui.map() }}
<p class="small soft"><span class="todo">[[TODO: brand-coloured static map image]]</span> Until then the map shows a quiet pattern; it already links to Google Maps.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

{#- ===== Forms ===== -#}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="forms">
<div class="wrap">
{{ ui.sectionHead("Contact form", eyebrow="Components · 13", id="forms", lead="Floating labels on a fine line, a 2px Espresso line on focus, plain-English errors with an icon, and a calm thank-you. The live form uses Netlify Forms with a hidden spam trap.") }}
<div class="grid grid--2" style="--gap:var(--s-7) var(--s-6)">
<div class="stack">
<h3 class="h4">Try it (nothing is sent)</h3>
{{ ui.contactForm(demo=true, idp="sg-live") }}
</div>
<div class="stack-l">
<div class="stack">
<h3 class="h4">Error state</h3>
{{ ui.contactForm(demo=true, state="error", idp="sg-err") }}
</div>
<div class="stack">
<h3 class="h4">Success state</h3>
{{ ui.contactForm(demo=true, state="success", idp="sg-ok") }}
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
